# Stopped mid-loop: a new version waits for its boundary exactly as
# while playing, so continuing never lands in the middle of a new
# pattern. A track started from nothing while stopped waits for the
# next whole beat. seq_clear while stopped removes tracks at once;
# their settings are kept for the next version.
open virtual
track 1 60:4
track 2:2 72:4
vel 2 = 50
play continue
runto 1.5
play stop
log
track 1 62:4
track 3:3 76:1
clear 2
clear 2 4
state
play continue
runto 6
log
track 2 74:1
state
runto 7
log
